					<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 sm:text-right">
						<span class="lang-zh">瑞典央行 1968 年增设 · 2026 诺奖系列终章</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Est. 1968 by Riksbank · 2026 Nobel Series Finale</span>
